res the library can adapt to various caching requirements and resource cons=
traints.</p>
<h2 id=3D"step-3-high-level-client-architecture">Step 3: High-level client =
architecture</h2>
<p>With the API design established, we now shift our focus to crafting a hi=
gh-level client architecture that powers our pagination library. This struc=
ture must prioritize modularity, scalability, and maintainability to integr=
ate seamlessly into a variety of mobile applications.</p>
