lign: left;"><strong>Advantages</strong></th><th style=3D"text-align: left;=
"><strong>Disadvantages</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=3D"t=
ext-align: left;">Separate queues for each priority level</td><td style=3D"=
